ation 集中管理元数据和数据权限，提供细粒度的行列级数据访问控制，并能在用户群中灵活扩展权限。通过 AWS Data Exchange，Lake Formation 促进了内部和外部的数据共享，无需移动数据即可构建数据网格。此外，Lake Formation 通过按角色和用户跟踪数据交互，提供全面的数据访问审计，确保数据在正确的时间由正确的用户访问。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"207"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073524854.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >5.湖仓和数仓抉择</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >常规数据中台</font> or 数据仓库项目建设中，如：Dataworks+Maxcompute，Dataphin+Maxcompute等等，数据都是进入Maxcompute的ODS层，然后依据数仓的分层理论（ODS，CDM，ADS各层）进行数仓的最终实施落地。</span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >而湖仓一体设计，是基于</font>OSS实现数据入湖，作为湖仓中的ODS层，而后基于Maxcompute做数仓的CDM、ADS层建设</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >那么什么条件下</font>/业务场景下可用（或者建议）使用（DLF+）OSS+Maxcompute来构建湖仓一体的架构呢？</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >个人理解可以从以下几点来看：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.&nbsp;数据非直接落成数据库系统中，如文本类且数据格式比较标准的。比如制造行业的设备检测数据，标准化格式文本输出，但是是存储在Excel中；或者客户侧通过RPA等技术手段爬取下来的数据，且只存储成了文本数据（如Excel形式），不太愿意多做程序改造，直接写入Maxcompute、Datahub等此类产品。实际项目交付过程中，也需要对齐定制转换成CSV格式，才能正常消费和应用。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据使用对象技术功底比较弱，如业务部门。希望能对原始数据随时做分析和校验等。往往这一条实际项目中个人理解比重更大一些。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >那么什么条件下</font>/业务场景下可用使用Dataworks/Dataphin+Maxcompute来构建数据仓库系统呢？</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >个人理解可以从以下几点来看：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.&nbsp;</span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >结构化数据清晰</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，可以利用如</font>Dataworks 数据集成等产品已有数据同步能力实现数据入Maxcompute中，</span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >直接构建</font>ODS层</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2. 数据使用场景 ：主要是面向BI分析和数据报表，</span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >对实时性要求没有那么高的诉求</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >；</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >6.湖仓架构设计实际案例</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >案例</font><font face=3D"宋体" >1：电池制造行业</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1. 需求说明</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"218"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073525738.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >原始基础样例数据如下：通过解析</font>Excel中的多个sheet页数据，将数据提取并展示成下图。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"249"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073525933.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >最终数据分析结果展示如下：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"213"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073526096.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2. 架构设计</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.整体架构设计</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"687"  height=3D"342"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073526263.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(64,64,64);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据接入：对于原始</font>Excel类型数据，通过java定</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >制</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >开</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >发</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >程序进行读取和解析，转换成</font>CSV文件，写入OSS中。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"233"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073526470.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3. 湖仓方案实现</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3.1. DLF+OSS+Maxcompute</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >通过</font>DLF实现了对OSS上csv文件的元数据统一管理并注册至Maxcompute中，实现在Maxcompute中直接访问OSS的外部数据。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >说明：当前</font>DLF未在专有云中进行输出。以下实现基于公有云产品组件。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"234"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073526758.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"237"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073526907.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3.2. OSS+Maxcompute</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >通过</font>Maxcompute外部表方式来实现湖仓设计。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >注意事项：</font>OSS上文件路径组织格式可参考project_nama/table_name/partition_name的方式。便于在Maxcompute中构建分区表。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"219"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073527185.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >分区表数据自动识别并挂载：主要是通过</font>msck repair语法来实现oss上新增数据文件自动发现。需要在Dataworks上的脚本任务中添加此代码，保障每次运行前拉取到最新的数据。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"238"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073527425.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >案例</font><font face=3D"宋体" >2：纸制造行业</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1. 需求说明</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >针对传统关系型数据库中、开源大数据组件中的数据，以及客户侧内部系统来源各个电商平台的</font>RPA店铺数据，存在大量结构化和非结构化数据，需要进行统一的数据管理和应用。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2. 架构设计</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >针对非结构化</font>Excel类型的电商店铺销量数据，通过定开程序对原始数据进行解析和结构化，入到OSS构建的湖中，再结合Maxcompute的外表特性实现对OSS中的数据统一纳管。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"244"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073527771.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >3. 湖仓方案实现</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3.1. OSS+Maxcompute</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >OSS上标准路径划分样例，如下图：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"145"  src=3D"~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}3607352.files/~tmp{4a565f06-f499-4846-af35-440033bdb6df}36073527969.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >基于</font>DLF构建湖仓方案，当时遇到一些使用上的不足项</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l1 level1 lfo10;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >DLF元数据抽取，存在自定义字段与系统自动同步数据错位问题</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l1 level1 lfo10;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >DLF对表头数据过滤不显示，参数只生效一次问题</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l1 level1 lfo10;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Maxcompute访问DLF外部项目空间，权限授权异常问题</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l1 level1 lfo10;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(24,24,24);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >DLF数据入湖任务，元数据迁移任务与Dataworks任务调度依赖当前无法打通问题</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >基于</font>OSS+Maxcompute的外表方案，实际开发上也需要对最新分区数据进行判断是否存在或者更新，前置数据同步任务不像Dataworks DI等组件之间可以直接实现任务依赖的监听，保障数据处理的完整性</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >所以，在实际项目的落地上，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >非以上业务特性，最好还是直接入仓</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，链路及开发链路相对简短和稳健。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

